 {'i': 25, 'id': 'u1781145257351505', 'date': '2026-10-28', 'cat': 'Announcement', 'show': 'event-archive', 'head': "Let's Learn About Menopause!", 'paras': [['Join us for an evening of learning, connection, and support at our upcoming Menopause Wellness Workshop!'], ['This interactive workshop is designed for Indigenous women to come together, share experiences, and learn more about navigating menopause in a welcoming and supportive environment.'], ['Throughout the evening, we’ll explore:'], ['Nutrition & Traditional Foods – Discover simple, nourishing foods to support your well-being.'], ['Movement & Exercise – Learn ways to build strength, improve mobility, and feel your best.'], ['Menopause Education – Better understand common symptoms, changes, and available supports.'], ['Connection & Support – Connect with others, share experiences, and build community.'], ['A FREE menopause-friendly meal and tea will also be provided!'], ['Tuesday, November 10, 2026'], ['5:00 PM – 8:00 PM'], ['14 York Road, Unit 4, Shannonville'], ['Registration is required! Please complete the registration form below to reserve your spot:'], ['https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScu-klxw52vJfIDB5cUIm4eYZRFhkuA7uGDV3YWn9lG-z8HIQ/viewform'], ['Priority will be given to IIPCT rostered patients and Indigenous community members on and off territory.'], ['For questions or more information, please contact allison.loft@iipct.com.'], ['We look forward to an evening of learning, wellness, and connection!']], 'note': None, 'img': ('news/2026-10-28-let-s-learn-about-menopause.jpg', 640, 828, 'news/2026-10-28-let-s-learn-about-menopause-full.jpg', "Flyer: Let's Learn About Menopause!", 'images/2026-10-28_0917_1.jpg'), 'fb': 'https://www.facebook.com/IIPCT.TMT/posts/pfbid02Y9SkY8gtCP9tFySb6zivJx8DSgXGy6H1gUwYHDHtdYtj6MHvgyRy66MWYsGGgoiFl'},
